/Title (Grama Jyothi Rural Electricity Co-operative bills about 4,000 households every month. The billing program reads previous and current meter readings, calculates consumption, applies slab-based energy charges, and must correctly handle a 16-bit meter rollover from 65535 to 0. The design should also be suitable for growth from a village to a district-scale system.)
