<<
/Title (Alternative concept: If an entire line were read with fgets\(\) and then converted using strtol\(\)/strtoul\(\), the program could inspect the whole line and identify trailing or unexpected characters more precisely. Direct scanf is shorter for controlled input, while fgets + conversion generally provides stronger input validation.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 421 0 R
/Prev 470 0 R
/Next 451 0 R
>>
